<title>SOUTH KOREA: Two South Koreans killed in apartment fire.</title>
<headline>Two South Koreans killed in apartment fire.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-03-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two people died and 12 were injured on Sunday when fire swept through an apartment building in the South Korean capital Seoul, police said.</p>
<p>The victims were a three-year-old girl and a 40-year-old man, a policeman said. &quot;We think a gas explosion caused the blaze,&quot; he added.</p>
</text>
